# Local tooling and generated junk
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
dist/
.cache/
e2e-screenshots/
08_realistic_digital_twin/models/*.blend1
# position maps of the painted skins: written by blender/posmaps.py, read by the texture generator
08_realistic_digital_twin/assets/posmaps/
# the handbook plates: the finer dial artwork is rebuilt (python3 09_book_figures/handbook/fine_textures.py)
09_book_figures/handbook/cache/
# the handbook plates: the raw renders of new plates and their web SVGs are large and are made again by `npm run plates:render` and
# `npm run plates:build` (Blender needed); what is kept is the finished plate of the book in 09_book_figures/handbook/out/book
09_book_figures/handbook/renders/
# (kept by name with `git add -f`: the small <id>.anchors.json of each render that a figure reads, where its points fell in the picture;
# without them the plates' spec cannot load in a fresh clone. 09_book_figures/tests/test_plates.py names any that is missing)
09_book_figures/handbook/out/*.svg
# the aerodrome atlas: the cards are made again from data/ (python3 09_book_figures/atlas/card.py; node 09_book_figures/atlas/rasterize_cards.mjs)
09_book_figures/atlas/cache/
